	(text "CAL_REF: 5th MAX2837, used as transmitter only.\nCAL = 1 (PA12): Rx inputs on the calibration splitter, Tx feeds the splitter.\nCAL = 0: Rx inputs on the antennas, Tx goes to J8\nTx enable = PB3, CS = PC6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
